  "details": "A user in a station with an animation controller doesn't animate to beta users if on live and vice versa. They DO correctly sync across live-to-live.\n\nCan view this using the DJ Controller station in https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_155f0899-38b8-41f9-9a87-ad91a076b45e\n\nThis seems to be a regression of https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/toggles-not-syncing-across-versions/",
